    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-apocalyptic RPG in an open world sandbox.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0e <strong>Full crafting</strong> \u2014 technology, turrets, weapons, bases, robots, tools, and landscape alteration.<br>\ud83d\ude97 <strong>50+ vehicles</strong> \u2014 cars, jetpacks, ships, platforms, teleports.<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Open world</strong> \u2014 islands, infected zones, underwater territories (in development).<br>\ud83e\uddec <strong>RPG system</strong> \u2014 levels, skills, achievements, full character customization.<br>\u2694 <strong>Combat</strong> \u2014 mutants, mercenaries, hand-to-hand combat, shooting.<br>\ud83c\udfd7 <strong>Base building</strong> \u2014 shelters, garages, farms, generators, defense systems, and minefields.<br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Survival</strong> \u2014 hunger, thirst, sleep, stamina, infection.<br>\ud83e\uddcd <strong>60+ NPCs</strong> \u2014 dialogues, quests, traders.<br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Cinematic graphics</strong> \u2014 style and atmosphere settings.<br>\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Regular updates</strong> \u2014 new content, story events, mechanic improvements, and additions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539280/extras/6d0bea83c3f3fff40a1f8c2e5e69a942.avif?t=1745366034\" data-has-big /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539280/extras/3974783e9a711669505047876a97e021.avif?t=1745366034\" data-has-big /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539280/extras/b1043d8cdd54a8327302a2bb0b497e88.avif?t=1745366034\" data-has-big /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539280/extras/a88e0c3db9308c553f28ad9fc6fd75f1.avif?t=1745366034\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
